  "description": "Yu-eul, who was born as the granddaughter of a rich family, had one taste that she could not help.\nSleeping with a trash man. He also enjoyed humiliating and being a replacement.\n\n“Are you planning on sleeping with me? Children from chaebol families aren’t allowed to go around anywhere.”\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/gkaqnfheogo), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/be_treated_recklessly), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000067839), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1515037682), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12185657), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=250071), [Toomics](https://www.toomics.com/webtoon/episode/toon/8604) \n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[French](https://www.lezhinfr.com/detail/daf_1000861), [Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/thwt_4197)",
